        <mxCell id="node_fast_path" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 14px; color: #86efac;&quot;&gt;DIRECT OUTPUT, 0 OVERHEAD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color: #065f46;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #e2e8f0;&quot;&gt;• Xuất trực tiếp kết quả Turn 1 Cache (P_U)&lt;br&gt;• Triệt tiêu hoàn toàn Self-Correction Paradox&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;color: #a7f3d0;&quot;&gt;Độ chính xác Turn 1: 82.36%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
