        <mxCell id="card_debate" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color: #e9d5ff; font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;CONSENSUS SYNTHESIS (DEBATE ROUNDS 1 &amp;rarr; R)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border-color: #581c87;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #cbd5e1;&quot;&gt;• Fact-Anchor đưa chứng cứ đối kháng Bias-Auditor&lt;br&gt;• Judge Persona ban hành phán quyết chính thức: &lt;b style=&quot;color: #fde68a;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;answer&amp;gt;...&amp;lt;/answer&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#3b0764;strokeColor=#a855f7;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#ffffff;align=center;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
